 and an in-depth course in Algorithmic Complexity.", "requirement_zh": "本科学位须相当于 180 ECTS 学分或同等学力，并包含计算机技术/计算机科学与工程/计算机科学/信息技术类课程：三个不同科目合计 22.5 ECTS 学分，且必须包含面向对象编程、算法与数据结构、算法复杂度进阶课程各一门。", "importance": "required", "source_level": "program", "source_type": "official_retrieval", "verification_status": "official_verified", "source_url": "https://www.kth.se/en/studies/master/computer-science/entry-requirements-computer-science-1.419975", "source_cycle": "undated", "temporal_applicability": "undated", "temporal_note": "页面为当前入学要求，未注明适用学年；目标周期 Fall 2027 未经页面明确确认。", "applicability_stage": "pre_admission"}, {"category": "course", "requirement": "Track-specific special eligibility may apply to compulsory courses (stated under 'Special eligibility' in the syllabus). Examples: Multivariable analysis is a special eligibility requirement for compulsory courses within the Data analysis and Cognitive systems tracks; Human-computer interaction is a special entry requirement for compulsory courses within the Interaction Design track; additional prerequisites may exist for some conditionally elective or recommended courses.", "requirement_zh": "项目分轨内的必修课程可能有附加的特殊资格要求（见教学大纲中“特殊资格”标题）。示例：多元微积分是 Data analysis 与 Cognitive systems 分轨内必修课程的特殊资格要求；人机交互是 Interaction Design 分轨内必修课程的特殊入学要求；部分限选或推荐课程也可能存在额外先修要求。", "importance": "required", "source_level": "program", "source_type": "official_retrieval", "verification_status": "official_verified", "source_url": "https://www.kth.se/en/studies/master/computer-science/entry-requirements-computer-science-1.419975", "source_cycle": "undated", "temporal_applicability": "undated", "temporal_note": "页面为当前入学要求，未注明适用学年；目标周期 Fall 2027 未经页面明确确认。", "applicability_stage": "pre_admission"}, {"category": "language", "requirement": "English proficiency equivalent to the Swedish upper secondary course English 6/English Level 2. This can be met with an English test, for example an overall IELTS score of 6.5 or a TOEFL score of 4.5 (as literally stated on the page). It may also be met through completed upper secondary or university studies depending on country of previous studies.", "requirement_zh": "英语水平须相当于瑞典高中课程 English 6/English Level 2。可通过英语考试满足，例如雅思总分 6.5 或托福 4.5 分（按页面原文陈述；该托福数值在页面上表述异常，须以官方后续说明为准）。根据之前学习所在国家，也可能通过已完成的高中或大学学习满足该要求。", "importance": "required", "source_level": "program", "source_type": "official_retrieval", "verification_status": "official_verified", "source_url": "https://www.kth.se/en/studies/master/computer-science/entry-requirements-computer-science-1.419975", "source_cycle": "undated", "temporal_applicability": "undated", "temporal_note": "页面为当前入学要求，未注明适用学年；目标周期 Fall 2027 未经页面明确确认。具体认可考试清单见 University Admissions（非 kth.se 来源，未在此列出）。", "applicability_stage": "pre_admission"}, {"category": "materials", "requirement": "Degree certificates: official certificates of your completed degrees, with documentation requirements varying by country.", "requirement_zh": "学位证书：已完成学位的官方证书；不同国家的证明材料要求不同。", "importance": "required", "source_level": "program", "source_type": "official_retrieval", "verification_status": "official_verified", "source_url": "https://www.kth.se/en/studies/master/computer-science/entry-requirements-computer-science-1.419975", "source_cycle": "undated", "temporal_applicability": "undated", "temporal_note": "页面为当前入学要求，未注明适用学年；目标周期 Fall 2027 未经页面明确确认。", "applicability_stage": "pre_admission"}, {"category": "materials", "requirement": "Transcript: official transcript of courses and grades completed in your degree. Students from Swedish universities that use Ladok do not need to submit degree certificates or transcripts.", "requirement_zh": "成绩单：学位中已完成课程与成绩的官方成绩单。使用 Ladok 的瑞典大学学生无需提交学位证书或成绩单。", "importance": "required", "source_level": "program", "source_type": "official_retrieval", "verification_status": "official_verified", "source_url": "https://www.kth.se/en/studies/master/computer-science/entry-requirements-computer-science-1.419975", "source_cycle": "undated", "temporal_applicability": "undated", "temporal_note": "页面为当前入学要求，未注明适用学年；目标周期 Fall 2027 未经页面明确确认。", "applicability_stage": "pre_admission"}, {"category": "materials", "requirement": "Proof of English proficiency: depends on whether the requirement is met through a test or previous studies.", "requirement_zh": "英语水平证明：所需证明取决于是通过考试还是以往学习满足该要求。", "importance": "required", "source_level": "program", "source_type": "official_retrieval", "verification_status": "official_verified", "source_url": "https://www.kth.se/en/studies/master/computer-science/entry-requirements-computer-science-1.419975", "source_cycle": "undated", "temporal_applicability": "undated", "temporal_note": "页面为当前入学要求，未注明适用学年；目标周期 Fall 2027 未经页面明确确认。", "applicability_stage": "pre_admission"}, {"category": "materials", "requirement": "Identification: a copy of a passport with personal data and photograph, or other identification document.", "requirement_zh": "身份证明：含个人信息和照片的护照复印件，或其他身份证明文件。", "importance": "required", "source_level": "program", "source_type": "official_retrieval", "verification_status": "official_verified", "source_url": "https://www.kth.se/en/studies/master/computer-science/entry-requirements-computer-science-1.419975", "source_cycle": "undated", "temporal_applicability": "undated", "temporal_note": "页面为当前入学要求，未注明适用学年；目标周期 Fall 2027 未经页面明确确认。", "applicability_stage": "pre_admission"}, {"category": "materials", "requirement": "CV (programme document): no standard template required; must clearly and concisely outline education, relevant research or work experience, extracurricular activities, qualifications and achievements, and must be written in English.", "requirement_zh": "简历（项目文件）：KTH 不要求标准模板，但应清晰简明地概述教育背景、相关研究或工作经历、课外活动、资质与成就（奖项、发表、专业知识与技能等），且须以英文撰写。", "importance": "required", "source_level": "program", "source_type": "official_retrieval", "verification_status": "official_verified", "source_url": "https://www.kth.se/en/studies/master/computer-science/entry-requirements-computer-science-1.419975", "source_cycle": "undated", "temporal_applicability": "undated", "temporal_note": "页面为当前入学要求，未注明适用学年；目标周期 Fall 2027 未经页面明确确认。", "applicability_stage": "pre_admission"}, {"category": "materials", "requirement": "Letter of motivation (programme document): must be in English and less than 500 words; explain choice of programme at KTH and how interests/skills will help succeed; if applying to multiple programmes requiring a letter, submit one for each stating the programme at the top.", "requirement_zh": "动机信（项目文件）：须为英文且少于 500 词；说明为何选择 KTH 该项目的动机及兴趣与技能如何帮助学业成功。如申请多个需要动机信的项目，须分别提交并在一页顶部注明所对应的项目。", "importance": "required", "source_level": "program", "source_type": "official_retrieval", "verification_status": "official_verified", "source_url": "https://www.kth.se/en/studies/master/computer-science/entry-requirements-computer-science-1.419975", "source_cycle": "undated", "temporal_applicability": "undated", "temporal_note": "页面为当前入学要求，未注明适用学年；目标周期 Fall 2027 未经页面明确确认。", "applicability_stage": "pre_admission"}, {"category": "materials", "requirement": "Letters of recommendation (programme document): two letters describing why you are the right choice for admission; preferably one academic and one professional referee; provide English translation if in another language; must include referees' full contact details; referees submitting themselves must send by post to University Admissions with your name and application number (cannot be submitted by email).", "requirement_zh": "推荐信（项目文件）：两封说明为何你是合适录取人选的推荐信；最好一封来自学术环境、一封来自职业环境；若为非英语语言须提供英文翻译；须包含推荐人完整联系方式；若推荐人自行提交，须邮寄至 University Admissions 并注明你的姓名与申请号（不得通过电子邮件提交）。", "importance": "required", "source_level": "program", "source_type": "official_retrieval", "verification_status": "official_verified", "source_url": "https://www.kth.se/en/studies/master/computer-science/entry-requirements-computer-science-1.419975", "source_cycle": "undated", "temporal_applicability": "undated", "temporal_note": "页面为当前入学要求，未注明适用学年；目标周期 Fall 2027 未经页面明确确认。", "applicability_stage": "pre_admission"}, {"category": "materials", "requirement": "Summary sheet for Computer Science: submit via the provided link when the application opens (do not upload to the application on universityadmissions.se). Failure to submit a complete summary sheet negatively affects the evaluation score.", "requirement_zh": "计算机科学项目摘要表：申请开放时通过指定链接提交（请勿上传到 universityadmissions.se 上的申请中）。未提交完整的摘要表将对其评估分数产生负面影响。", "importance": "required", "source_level": "program", "source_type": "official_retrieval", "verification_status": "official_verified", "source_url": "https://www.kth.se/en/studies/master/computer-science/entry-requirements-computer-science-1.419975", "source_cycle": "undated", "temporal_applicability": "undated", "temporal_note": "页面为当前入学要求，未注明适用学年；目标周期 Fall 2027 未经页面明确确认。", "applicability_stage": "pre_admission"}, {"category": "other", "requirement": "Selection criteria: based on study results (grades from previous studies), motivation for the studies (awards, prizes and publications) and previous education. Prior education is evaluated on quality and suitability of relevant subjects; for international prior education, university ranking is also part of the merit rating. Merit rating is on a scale of 1-75.", "requirement_zh": "选拔标准：基于学业成绩（以往学习的成绩）、学习动机（奖项、荣誉与发表）以及以往教育背景。以往教育按其与所申请项目相关科目的质量与适宜性评估；对国际以往教育背景，大学排名也计入评分。评分采用 1–75 分制。", "importance": "unknown", "source_level": "program", "source_type": "official_retrieval", "verification_status": "official_verified", "source_url": "https://www.kth.se/en/studies/master/computer-science/entry-requirements-computer-science-1.419975", "source_cycle": "undated", "temporal_applicability": "undated", "temporal_note": "页面为当前入学要求，未注明适用学年；目标周期 Fall 2027 未经页面明确确认。该条为信息性说明，非申请人须满足的硬性门槛。", "applicability_stage": "informational"}]}

